        <field name="standard_price">3500</field>
        <field name="type">product</field>
        <field name="external_image_url">https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505740420928-5e560c06d30e?w=900&amp;q=80&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop</field>
        <field name="description_sale">Studio-grade wireless headphones with 40-hour battery life and adaptive noise cancellation. Engineered for travel, focus work, and audiophile listening.</field>
        <field name="ai_description">&lt;p&gt;Step into a private concert hall with the Aura Pro. Hybrid 40mm drivers deliver warm lows and crystal-clear highs, while four-microphone adaptive ANC silences your commute. The 40-hour battery and rapid 10-minute charge mean you can grab them on the way out and not look back.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Memory foam earcups, aerospace-grade aluminium hinges, and a 240g featherweight chassis make 12-hour wear effortless.&lt;/p&gt;</field>
